---
title: "oauth_client_delete (stem-system: Admin OAuth Client Deletion)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: supabase.auth.getUser()
    q_auth --> q_no_auth: no user
    q_auth --> q_check_admin: user present
    q_no_auth --> [*]: return 401 Unauthorized
    q_check_admin --> q_query_admin: select is_admin from members
    q_query_admin --> q_not_admin: not admin
    q_query_admin --> q_delete: is admin
    q_not_admin --> [*]: return 403 Forbidden
    q_delete --> q_rpc: rpc delete_application(id from params)
    q_rpc --> q_error: error or not deleted
    q_rpc --> q_success: deleted
    q_error --> [*]: return 500 failed to delete
    q_success --> [*]: return success=true

    note right of q_delete
        INV-001: deletion uses RPC via cookie-based client (RLS applies)
    end note
